        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 67/67A",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 688,
          "end": 703
        },
        {
          "text": "Information Technology (Amendment) Act, 2008",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 711,
          "end": 755
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.6246088743209839
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "The prosecution case is that the victim lady became friends with the petitioner after coming in contact with him on face book.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 757,
      "end": 884,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5172721743583679
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The petitioner used to reside close to the residence of the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 885,
      "end": 952,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.49233102798461914
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The friendship developed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 953,
      "end": 978,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31862932443618774
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "One day, taking advantage of the absence of the victim's husband, the petitioner went to her and offered her some Prasad.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 979,
      "end": 1100,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.39802834391593933
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "After consuming the Prasad she felt dizzy.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1101,
      "end": 1143,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3878977298736572
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "She was then ravished by the petitioner against her wishes.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1144,
      "end": 1203,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3702431321144104
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The petitioner took indecent pictures of the victim lady and threatened to circulate the same in the social media.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1204,
      "end": 1318,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4172138273715973
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Signed By :\nAPURBA BANDYOPADHYAY High Court of Calcutta 13 th of June 2024 06:22:42 PM",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1319,
      "end": 1405,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "APURBA BANDYOPADHYAY",
          "label": "JUDGE",
          "start": 1331,
          "end": 1351
        },
        {
          "text": "High Court of Calcutta",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1352,
          "end": 1374
        },
        {
          "text": "13 th of June 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1375,
          "end": 1393
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "The petitioner denies all such allegations.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1406,
      "end": 1449,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.387125700712204
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "He says that he has been falsely framed in the matter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1450,
      "end": 1504,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33671385049819946
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "He is in custody for 144 days.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1505,
      "end": 1535,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.40687939524650574
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Charge has not been framed as yet.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1536,
      "end": 1570,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37378889322280884
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "He should be released on bail on whatever conditions this Court may decide.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1571,
      "end": 1646,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3398788273334503
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "We have considered the material in the case diary including the statement of the victim lady recorded under Section 164 Cr.P.C.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1647,
      "end": 1775,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 164",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1756,
          "end": 1767
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1768,
          "end": 1775
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1797577142715454
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "We find that prima facie, there is enough incriminating evidence against the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 1776,
      "end": 1864,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27592846751213074
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Hence, we are not inclined to allow this application for bail, at this stage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1865,
      "end": 1942,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06529977172613144
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "The prayer for bail is, accordingly, rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1943,
      "end": 1990,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1712026745080948
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "CRM (DB) 1692 of 2024 is dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 1991,
      "end": 2026,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "CRM (DB) 1692 of 2024",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1991,
          "end": 2012
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07151714712381363
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "However, we request the learned Trial Court to address the issue of framing of charges immediately and expedite the trial so that the same can reach its logical conclusion at the earliest.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2027,
      "end": 2215,
